 sh(3,'wine-list-white-cloth-sommelier-pouring-red','A tall wine list card stands upright on the white tablecloth while a sommelier\'s hand pours deep red wine into a large crystal glass beside it.','Camera at table height, 85mm lens, f/4, square to the card face. The card fills about 30 percent of the frame width and most of its height on the centre line, sharp; to one side the wine streams into the glass, glowing ruby in the warm beam and throwing a red caustic on the cloth; dark candlelit dining room behind.',CARD('WINE LIST CARD'),'the wine list card',comp=None,people=H),
 sh(4,'place-card-full-fine-dining-setting-ivory-linen','A folded place card stands on ivory oat linen in front of a full fine-dining place setting: a gold-rimmed charger plate, four filled crystal glasses and heavy silver cutlery laid in rows.','Camera at about 30 degrees above the table, 50mm lens, f/4, square to the card face. The card face fills about 35 percent of the frame width on the centre line, sharp; the setting fans out behind it, softly lit, the glasses throwing caustics on the linen.',CARD('PLACE CARD FACE'),'the place card face',comp='A'),
 sh(5,'menu-card-marble-silver-tray-oysters-on-ice','A menu card lies on the white marble table beside a polished silver tray of fresh oysters on crushed ice with lemon halves.','Camera straight down, 50mm lens, f/5.6. The card lies on the centre line, edges parallel to the frame, filling about 40 percent of the frame width, sharp; the oyster tray fills the top of the frame, glistening; a full flute of champagne at the side throws a bright caustic on the marble beside the card.',CARD('MENU CARD'),'the menu card'),
 sh(6,'business-card-bronze-crystal-decanter-cognac','A business card lies on the polished bronze bar beside a hand-cut crystal decanter and a full balloon glass of cognac, both throwing deep amber caustics across the metal.','Camera straight down, 50mm lens, f/5.6. The card lies on the centre line, flat, filling about 40 percent of the frame width, sharp; the decanter stopper and the glass rim at the top edge sparkle; rich amber light pools on the bronze beside the card, never over it.',CARD('BUSINESS CARD'),'the business card'),
